<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>柯达E100 on MEROCO</title><link>https://mint.moe/tags/%E6%9F%AF%E8%BE%BEe100/</link><description>Recent content in 柯达E100 on MEROCO</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://mint.moe/tags/%E6%9F%AF%E8%BE%BEe100/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>大理之旅</title><link>https://mint.moe/p/a-journey-to-dali/</link><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mint.moe/p/a-journey-to-dali/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/d4cfb1e309ead5d320eab808690667d7.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 大理之旅" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;10月23日至27日去大理玩了五天，除去头尾交通日，实际三天。这是我第一次来大理，特意挑国庆后的淡季，游客应该少一些，结果还是被人流吓到了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="day1"&gt;Day1
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;傍晚安置好行理后就来大理古城逛逛，古城的商铺同质化严重，漫无目的逛了几个小时，原计划找家酒馆拍初音，古城的酒馆也确实多，但全对不上电波，意外中找到家满目蓝色的邮政纪念品店，带阿喵进去拍了几张照。逛累后尝试了云南本地奶茶品牌“上山喝茶”的酸角大王，酸甜口的，非常有辨识度，我给到夯中夯！烤乳扇香甜软糯，也是一绝，如有机会请务必尝试。第一天在走走逛逛吃吃中结束了。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="酸角大王，夯！" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="900" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/ccf65e1429fc589f13eb7dc5e63bec8b.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/ccf65e1429fc589f13eb7dc5e63bec8b_8429751911778443726_hu_a857acb8e56a6671.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/ccf65e1429fc589f13eb7dc5e63bec8b.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="阿喵逛文创" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/12cb961fb297f2f965352ad0803f0df2.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/12cb961fb297f2f965352ad0803f0df2_10249289163222436043_hu_bd5af723f3160079.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/12cb961fb297f2f965352ad0803f0df2.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="玉华楼" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="160px" data-flex-grow="66" height="1800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/c1b347d14cc90479e0ec65a6d322108c.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/c1b347d14cc90479e0ec65a6d322108c_16988042439526727006_hu_c20f21b3b966bcc5.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/c1b347d14cc90479e0ec65a6d322108c.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="day2"&gt;Day2
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;第二天计划去龙龛码头拍摄日出，说起来这还是我第一次拍日出。天气APP显示日出时间为7:10，我6:10抵达码头，经过一番踩点，挑了个临水的围拦就位，RolleiFlex3.5F被架设在富图宝P2三角架上，Z6II直接放在围栏上，等待太阳探出远山的那一刻。用文字描述日出是比较困难的，因为天空无时无刻都在变化，我更倾向于用音乐作品传达。毫无疑问，理查·施特劳斯的交响诗《查拉图斯特拉如是说》开头的“日出”段落就是最佳代表，亲眼看过后我更加确信这点，也难怪斯坦利·库布里克会将这段用于电影 《2001太空漫游》 的开篇。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="取景器里的东方既白" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/ae00ef173e8a87d3009d013368f29b40.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/ae00ef173e8a87d3009d013368f29b40_13472817382825815158_hu_1bf1694cfd5dab92.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/ae00ef173e8a87d3009d013368f29b40.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="用上ND镜会更壮观" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="798" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/ca2aa413bd0989cf70e45f8a58e2d676.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/ca2aa413bd0989cf70e45f8a58e2d676_991692109206782670_hu_a2cc142f1b9388bd.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/ca2aa413bd0989cf70e45f8a58e2d676.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="DAYBREAK FRONTLINE" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/597d059f801f3a310bc840071921cdf2.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/597d059f801f3a310bc840071921cdf2_3735364104714473707_hu_591235883fd9c0cf.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/597d059f801f3a310bc840071921cdf2.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;太阳逐渐爬升，我收拾好设备往南走，找到了一处近水背光有红杉树遮挡的位置给初音拍照，准备妥当后才发现忘带䘵莱的闪光同步线，DD的脸还莫名其妙染成了小花猫。双重暴击下，那个瞬间我一度以为要白费力气了，好在我很快调整心态，只拍半边娃脸，增加曝光舍弃背景，将拍摄重心从反转片转移到数码相机，用AD200离机闪拍了几张保底照片，效果还算满意。其实拍摄中途被一位刚摄影师硬控住聊了将近一小时，所以没有再给DD摆其它姿势，至于聊天的起因当然是䘵莱双反的强大吸引力。回程路上我在便利店买了一包卸妆湿布，抱着试试看的心理结果真擦掉了，心情直接反转。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="这就是顶美" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/e58c74ba3dea128aeff9fb63c89fb645.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/e58c74ba3dea128aeff9fb63c89fb645_16664251179656216087_hu_e2b614635d79e060.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/e58c74ba3dea128aeff9fb63c89fb645.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="顶美的侧颜" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/5e78aaaad1c47dd05021b53d6188d7c9.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/5e78aaaad1c47dd05021b53d6188d7c9_1833030669677876105_hu_e80d76ca01be80fb.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/5e78aaaad1c47dd05021b53d6188d7c9.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;休整片刻后，下午带阿喵游崇圣寺三塔。作为大理唯一的5A级景点，我还是很推荐去的，仅仅是为了出片打卡也值。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="阿喵探头" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/d4cfb1e309ead5d320eab808690667d7.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/d4cfb1e309ead5d320eab808690667d7_713653627558753364_hu_f8ca6ee1419ecbf7.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/d4cfb1e309ead5d320eab808690667d7.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="钟楼三楼机位" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/9b7f08d75a187c79df1619366833eb13.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/9b7f08d75a187c79df1619366833eb13_10925767532990057699_hu_463dbdf6c43793c9.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/9b7f08d75a187c79df1619366833eb13.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="仰视主塔" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="160px" data-flex-grow="66" height="1800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/421dd3c1b15f57c23fbcbc223f942dce.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/421dd3c1b15f57c23fbcbc223f942dce_6660743672356468774_hu_a3de94f9d866cbc7.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/421dd3c1b15f57c23fbcbc223f942dce.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="倒影潭" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/3cead266d1b7d9a01001cd6a10769101.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/3cead266d1b7d9a01001cd6a10769101_15096301637074175764_hu_b92ae3b8bcba877f.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/3cead266d1b7d9a01001cd6a10769101.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;晚上实在不想出门（其实第一天晚上逛完古城脚底就已经很疼了），点了个云南本地菜外卖，㕿喷喷的牛肝菌炒饭和香辣可口的饵块糍粑辣子鸡，&lt;del&gt;初音喂我吃&lt;/del&gt;，吃得很爽。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="秀色可餐" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/b0b5d3bd8ef69885899d98b679223946.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/b0b5d3bd8ef69885899d98b679223946_5305823487864942599_hu_2877a87db0fd6656.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/b0b5d3bd8ef69885899d98b679223946.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="day3"&gt;Day3
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;第三天还是在洱海西边玩，上午在海边骑行，只带了手机和RolleiFlex3.5F，网红S湾人很多但我不觉得好看，反而是沿途的景色更吸引人。下午租车以便找景拍照，地图上「洱海最美一公里」名副其实，随便选一段都能激情爽拍。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="红彬树逐渐变红" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/2fc6f8528795b89da90d5bcbfc358bb4.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/2fc6f8528795b89da90d5bcbfc358bb4_12672205823360537304_hu_a30261ad5c64178e.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/2fc6f8528795b89da90d5bcbfc358bb4.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="柯达Gold200" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="243px" data-flex-grow="101" height="1182" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/db6c76227e02ba2a8222dcb2e3decad3.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/db6c76227e02ba2a8222dcb2e3decad3_9218996321484734268_hu_763231487f0ffde4.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/db6c76227e02ba2a8222dcb2e3decad3.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="躺猫猫" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/c29b4d2c1b14c55c8d19130332c869d7.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/c29b4d2c1b14c55c8d19130332c869d7_6785295969793987198_hu_7c3881916ada349b.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/c29b4d2c1b14c55c8d19130332c869d7.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="花と記憶" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/7e5b0188d7b9c25da00cb93f3706cc4e.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/7e5b0188d7b9c25da00cb93f3706cc4e_4014538607605175876_hu_9a055c4bbc62c2ce.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/7e5b0188d7b9c25da00cb93f3706cc4e.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="Synchronizer" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/84f4e95f2b88e4be32ab33c75d45495d.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/84f4e95f2b88e4be32ab33c75d45495d_1721527942697273415_hu_f85818e10532939e.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/84f4e95f2b88e4be32ab33c75d45495d.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="day4"&gt;Day4
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;第四天原计划上午去云想山拍宫崎骏的「起风了」海报类似的照片，到场后立刻放弃了，10点后可以凭消费进场，虽然顺光但接近正午光线太过强硬，又没有帽子雨伞之类能遮阳的东西，只好躺在露营椅上躲树荫里消磨时光。下午去洱海东边转了半圈，找了家开在悬崖上的咖啡厅等待日落，也迎来本次旅程的终结。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="rainbow" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/3cb73a48aa504608374a5f6ec9bb29cb.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/3cb73a48aa504608374a5f6ec9bb29cb_11740843075970082409_hu_60371b5d60150a6e.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/3cb73a48aa504608374a5f6ec9bb29cb.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="白兔洋装初音就能利用太阳伞拍「起风了」" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="800" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/f45dc49e8b016de97b96cbb1ea91708a.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/f45dc49e8b016de97b96cbb1ea91708a_11154192366218381295_hu_2ea7638df3080cda.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/f45dc49e8b016de97b96cbb1ea91708a.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="有喜有悲的反转片"&gt;有喜有悲的反转片
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="没有闪光灯逆光拍会降低对比度和饱和度" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="240px" data-flex-grow="100" height="1200" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/ed374bfcf67d0dd70defa40bf55d5aa5.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/ed374bfcf67d0dd70defa40bf55d5aa5_4628117774089565031_hu_75b021f8fdf45ac.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/ed374bfcf67d0dd70defa40bf55d5aa5.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="第一卷" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="900" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/29ea37ae6b8df5f7342b0bc4b63a5264.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/29ea37ae6b8df5f7342b0bc4b63a5264_8543971737525548170_hu_54c44ffca0b1daeb.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/29ea37ae6b8df5f7342b0bc4b63a5264.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="阴影里的肤色太蓝了下次用上雷登81A滤镜" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="240px" data-flex-grow="100" height="1200" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/3fcea10a6a6c39641e0366a262d7cba9.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/3fcea10a6a6c39641e0366a262d7cba9_13957563781171553967_hu_90c909acb342fd4a.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/3fcea10a6a6c39641e0366a262d7cba9.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt; &lt;img alt="第二卷" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="320px" data-flex-grow="133" height="900" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/966fbd79b0c7a6beb1382c738c605597.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/966fbd79b0c7a6beb1382c738c605597_8171424886411203154_hu_cc5bfcbfd11e03a8.jpg 800w, https://img.mint.moe/2026/11/966fbd79b0c7a6beb1382c738c605597.jpg 1200w" width="1200"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;旅途有遗憾是难免的，就跟拍反转片一样，正因有遗憾才会想再来一次，这就是大理给我的答案。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>采花大盗魔理沙</title><link>https://mint.moe/p/%E9%87%87%E8%8A%B1%E5%A4%A7%E7%9B%97%E9%AD%94%E7%90%86%E6%B2%99/</link><pubDate>Thu, 19 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://mint.moe/p/%E9%87%87%E8%8A%B1%E5%A4%A7%E7%9B%97%E9%AD%94%E7%90%86%E6%B2%99/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://img.mint.moe/2024/12/eafd2d2c21b950cba04360641d3eb81d.jpg" alt="Featured image of post 采花大盗魔理沙" /&gt;&lt;p&gt;去年向日葵娃片拍得不满意，埋下了种子，今年特意拍了两次，总算是留下了自己满意的照片。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;今年正好赶上向日葵满开，这片花田位于市中，傍水而开，金灿灿一大片叫人欢欣雀跃。出镜娃娃依旧是Volks MDD魔理沙，来和去年做一个比较，魔理沙的大帽子给拍摄带来了极大的麻烦，所以我使用SMDV的八爪柔光罩加神牛的闪光灯构成离机闪来给娃娃面部补光。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="采花大盗" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="1600" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2024/12/7c1638cea1783d6786405df58b0bbcab.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/7c1638cea1783d6786405df58b0bbcab_13056459825691778958_hu_d7d4706178157143.jpg 800w, https://mint.moe/7c1638cea1783d6786405df58b0bbcab_13056459825691778958_hu_3139c09414993a6b.jpg 1600w, https://img.mint.moe/2024/12/7c1638cea1783d6786405df58b0bbcab.jpg 2400w" width="2400"&gt; &lt;img alt="今天的风儿有点喧嚣" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="1600" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2024/12/eafd2d2c21b950cba04360641d3eb81d.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/eafd2d2c21b950cba04360641d3eb81d_5445413483281663707_hu_70e254ab30f41e5e.jpg 800w, https://mint.moe/eafd2d2c21b950cba04360641d3eb81d_5445413483281663707_hu_65f7437175b91b48.jpg 1600w, https://img.mint.moe/2024/12/eafd2d2c21b950cba04360641d3eb81d.jpg 2400w" width="2400"&gt; &lt;img alt="独爱向日葵" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="360px" data-flex-grow="150" height="1600" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2024/12/51e663f35cf0b9b71af926c92f998390.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/51e663f35cf0b9b71af926c92f998390_11198036665854514701_hu_23f10901d28e630d.jpg 800w, https://mint.moe/51e663f35cf0b9b71af926c92f998390_11198036665854514701_hu_b22b48d9138a2f32.jpg 1600w, https://img.mint.moe/2024/12/51e663f35cf0b9b71af926c92f998390.jpg 2400w" width="2400"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

 &lt;blockquote&gt;
 &lt;p&gt;前一张摄于8月4日，后一张摄于8月8日，数码相机打样。&lt;/p&gt;

 &lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;第一次拍完就马上委托同城的冲洗店加急冲洗，结果不出所料，完全逆光的情况下，即便使用闪光灯降低光比，反转片依旧难有准确的色彩表现。三天后安排了第二次拍摄，这次选择侧光拍摄，柯达反转片的色彩实力总算是发挥出来了，填补了去年的遗憾。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="柯达E100反转片" class="gallery-image" data-flex-basis="459px" data-flex-grow="191" height="1500" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 30px), (max-width: 1023px) 700px, (max-width: 1279px) 950px, 1232px" src="https://img.mint.moe/2024/12/c02e6e5da6c3bc326191873780055243.jpg" srcset="https://mint.moe/c02e6e5da6c3bc326191873780055243_3260641032336986190_hu_72ec3ea895a15545.jpg 800w, https://mint.moe/c02e6e5da6c3bc326191873780055243_3260641032336986190_hu_46d208d21bf9f4e7.jpg 1600w, https://mint.moe/c02e6e5da6c3bc326191873780055243_3260641032336986190_hu_c1482adb31373da3.jpg 2400w, https://img.mint.moe/2024/12/c02e6e5da6c3bc326191873780055243.jpg 2869w" width="2869"&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;观片台数字翻拍无法展现反转片的全部魅力，欣赏反转片最佳方式永远是肉眼直接看，所以我特意录了一段用幻灯机投影的效果，透过屏幕感受一下吧。






 


